<div class="space-y-6">

  <!-- Founder-Led Sales Process -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Your First Sales Process</h3>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">1</div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Build a List of 20 Target Customers</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Be specific: name, company, role, why they'd want this. Warm intros > cold outreach.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 italic">Example: "Emma Chen, Head of Marketing at Series A SaaS co, struggles with content ROI tracking"</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">2</div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Outreach Message (Keep it Short)</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">3 sentences max. Problem → Solution → Ask for 15 min call.</p>
          <div class="mt-2 p-3 bg-white rounded border border-gray-200 text-xs">
            <p class="text-gray-700 italic">"Hi [Name], saw you're working on [problem]. We built [product] that helps [outcome]. Would love to show you a quick demo - are you free for 15 min this week?"</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">3</div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Discovery Call (30 min)</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Spend 70% listening, 30% talking. Understand their world first.</p>
          <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>• "Walk me through your current process for [problem]"</li>
            <li>• "What's the biggest pain point you face?"</li>
            <li>• "How much does this problem cost you? (time/money)"</li>
            <li>• "What have you tried so far?"</li>
            <li>• "Who else is involved in this decision?"</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">4</div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Present Solution (15 min)</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Tailor your demo to THEIR specific problem you just learned about.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Structure: Recap their problem → Show how your product solves it → Share 1-2 customer examples → Pricing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">5</div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Handle Objections</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Write down EVERY objection. They're teaching you what's broken in your positioning.</p>
          <div class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1">
            <p><strong>"Too expensive"</strong> → Ask: "Compared to what? What's your budget?" Might be positioning issue.</p>
            <p><strong>"Need to think about it"</strong> → Ask: "What specifically do you need to think about?" Uncover real objection.</p>
            <p><strong>"Not the right time"</strong> → Ask: "When would be the right time? What needs to happen first?"</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">6</div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Close or Set Next Steps</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Always leave with a concrete next action. Never end with "I'll follow up."</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Examples: "Let's get you set up - I'll send onboarding link" or "I'll send proposal by Friday, can we review together Monday at 2pm?"</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">7</div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Follow Up Relentlessly</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">80% of sales happen after the 5th follow-up. Most founders give up after 1-2.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Cadence: Day 1 (call summary), Day 3 (check-in), Day 7 (value add content), Day 14 (final push)</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Early Pricing Strategy -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-emerald-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-green-200">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Early Stage Pricing Tips</h3>
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Charge Something (Even If Low)</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Free users rarely give feedback. Paying customers care. Start at $29-99/mo for B2B.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Test 3 Price Points</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Pitch $50/mo to first 5 prospects, $100/mo to next 5, $200/mo to last 5. See what converts.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Annual > Monthly</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Offer 2 months free for annual. Improves cash flow and retention. "Pay $500/year instead of $600."</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">"Founding Customer" Discount</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Offer locked-in rate forever. "You're getting in at $49/mo, but price goes to $99 next month."</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">Always Ask: "What Would Make This a No-Brainer?"</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Learn what features, guarantees, or pricing would make them say yes immediately.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Sales Tracker -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Track Every Sales Call</h3>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
          <tr>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold text-gray-900">Prospect</th>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold text-gray-900">Stage</th>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold text-gray-900">Pain Point</th>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold text-gray-900">Objection</th>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold text-gray-900">Next Step</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200">
          <tr class="bg-white">
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">Emma @ Acme Co</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2"><span class="px-2 py-1 bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 rounded text-xs">Demo</span></td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">Can't track ROI</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">Price concerns</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">Send case study</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="bg-gray-50">
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">John @ Beta Inc</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2"><span class="px-2 py-1 bg-green-100 text-green-800 rounded text-xs">Closed</span></td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">Manual reporting</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">None</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">Onboarding call</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="bg-white">
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">Sarah @ Gamma LLC</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2"><span class="px-2 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 rounded text-xs">Outreach</span></td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">TBD</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">-</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-600">Book discovery</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-3">Tip: Use a simple Google Sheet or Airtable. Track everything - these insights are gold.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Success Benchmarks -->
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-blue-600 rounded-xl p-6 text-white">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">20-30%</div>
      <p class="text-sm text-blue-100">Response rate (warm intros)</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-blue-200 mt-2">Cold outreach: 5-15%</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-purple-600 rounded-xl p-6 text-white">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">30-50%</div>
      <p class="text-sm text-purple-100">Discovery → Demo conversion</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-purple-200 mt-2">If lower, qualify better</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-green-600 rounded-xl p-6 text-white">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">20-40%</div>
      <p class="text-sm text-green-100">Demo → Close rate</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-green-200 mt-2">Early stage benchmark</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
